Subject: [PATCH 26/58] Gate G8: judge entity and term indexes against what
 each holder may publish (privacy invariant + coverage)

Expected entity set mirrors the effective-ACL publication rule and threshold; any indexed id outside it
fails as a privacy violation; term index checked structurally (rows only from holders with public
records, coverage of holders with public records). Engineer: WP3 (claude-sonnet-5-5); 115 harness
tests pass. C1-S1 gate re-run: valid (G1-G10 pass); entity part is privacy-only at default threshold 5.

